  nombre: Spookiest Gogoo
  type: 4
  dialogos:
  - "\u201CAs long as no one\u2019s near\u2026 I\u2019m comfortable.\u201D"
  - "\u201CI take no space, but don\u2019t want\u2026 company.\u201D"
  - "\u201CSilence is my only preference.\u201D"
  - "\u201CA room without neighbors\u2026 would be perfect.\u201D"
  - "\u201CSolitude feels\u2026 warm. Oddly.\u201D"
  dialogosPuzzleExito:
  - "\u201CSilence\u2026 exactly what I wanted.\u201D"
  dialogosPuzzleFallo:
  - "\u201CToo many presences\u2026 I can feel them.\u201D"
